/* Signal Box: the visual system shared by /dashboard/ and /manage/.

   Colour is a state vocabulary, not decoration. Each lamp means one thing:
     clear    green       the latest record for this stage succeeded
     caution  amber       look at this
     hold     amber       deliberately held back (shadow)
     stop     red         the latest record failed, or effects are blocked
     set      lunar white configured, which is not evidence of anything
     off      grey        dark: paused, ignored, or nothing recorded
